SUMMARY:Glass Blowing at grandview
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Grandview Vineyard for a glass blowing class!\nNo experience necessary\, After a brief demonstration students will make there own Plant waterer\, Shot glass or budvase.Mr. Peluso brings over 20 years of glass experence to his classes. Come knowing nothing about glass. Leave with a solid understanding. No experience nessesary.\nGlass will be ready to take home at the end of class.\nFor questions Call/Email Michael Peluso 7176084661 www.michaelpeluso.com\nCheck it out\nhttps://youtu.be/yEBYpWZslKs\n2 classes are available – 4:30 and 6:30\n\n4:30PM Tickets\nClick Here to Purchase Tickets\n\n6:30PM Tickets\nClick Here to Purchase Tickets
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/glass-blowing-at-grandview/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Glass-Blowing_May.png
END:VEVENT
